    "name": "wow-config (Forever, early leveling)",
    "url": "https://github.com/rymiwe/wow-config",
    "credit": "Ryan Weiss"
  },
  "notes": [
    "This is Ryan's key philosophy applied to a level-10 Forever paladin, not a layout that PaladinSetup will apply in game yet. There is no Forever PaladinSetup in the repo today.",
    "Holy Strike sits on 1 \u2014 the same slot Crusader Strike uses in the TBC layout. It is the instant melee filler, and it is the natural Forever home for that job.",
    "Empty keys are reserved for later spells (Consecration, Flash of Light, hands, and so on) so the map does not have to be unlearned as you level.",
    "Shift still mirrors the same buttons (and Shift-B opens bags). Blessings and auras stay on the Mouse 4 / Mouse 5 rings. Hammer of Justice is on ` once it is trained at level 8.",
    "Righteous Fury, if you want it while leveling, stays on the click-only utility bar rather than a combat key."
  ],
